flowchart TD
  S[Student] -->|Registration request| P1[1. Validate identity and request]
  P1 --> P2[2. Validate section status and capacity]
  P2 --> P3[3. Check duplicate, program and timetable]
  P3 -->|All checks pass| P4[4. Commit registration transaction]
  P3 -->|Validation error| E[Return actionable error]
  P4 <--> D1[(CourseSection)]
  P4 <--> D2[(Registration)]
  P4 --> D3[(Notification)]
  P4 --> R[Registration confirmation]
